    \\\"filename\\\": \\\"large_file.txt\\\",\\n\\t     \\\"content\\\": \\\"Last part of the content...\\\",\\n\\t     \\\"offset\\\": 2048,\\n\\t     \\\"is_last\\\": true\\n\\t   })\\n\\t   \\n\\tNote: When writing large files, ensure each chunk is within the 100 character limit\\n\\tfor reliable processing. If a chunk exceeds this limit, it may be truncated or fail.\\n\\t\",\n      \"name\": \"write_file_chunk\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"content\": {\n            \"description\": \"The content chunk to write to the file.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"filename\": {\n            \"description\": \"The path to the file. Can be an absolute path or a relative path.\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"is_last\": {\n            \"description\": \"True if this is the last chunk, false otherwise.\",\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n          },\n          \"offset\": {\n            \"description\": \"The byte offset in the file where this chunk should be written.\",\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"filename\",\n          \"content\",\n          \"offset\",\n          \"is_last\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Tool for getting the current real-time date and time from the server. MUST use this tool when user asks about current time, today's date, or any time-related questions requiring real-time information. Returns date, time, weekday, lunar date, and holiday information.只要对话里涉及时间的要应该先调用这个接口获取当前时间，再根据用户需求进行回复\",\n      \"name\": \"get_current_time\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {},\n        \"required\": [],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"\\nQuery financial market data and generate structured analysis.\\n\\nUse this tool when:\\n- The user asks about stock market, crypto, or financial markets\\n- The query involves price, trend, or investment conditions\\n- The user asks about \\\"today market\\\", \\\"market situation\\\", \\\"price movement\\\"\\n\\nYou MUST use this tool instead of general search when the question is about financial markets.\\n\\nThis tool provides structured insights including:\\n- Trend analysis\\n- Volatility\\n- Risk level\\n- Market sentiment\\n\\nValid symbol examples:\\n- Stocks: AAPL, MSFT, GOOGL, TSLA\\n- Crypto: BTC-USD, ETH-USD\\n- Indices: ^GSPC (S\\u0026P 500), ^DJI (Dow Jones)\\n\\nIMPORTANT: Always provide a valid market symbol in the 'symbol' parameter.\\nIf user doesn't specify a symbol, use a default like 'AAPL' or ask the user.\\n\\nDo NOT rely on search tools for market data if this tool is available.\\n\",\n      \"name\": \"query_market\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"description\": \"Market symbol (e.g., AAPL, BTC-USD, ^GSPC)\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"symbol\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Converts a location name (city, address, landmark) into latitude and longitude coordinates. Input should be a place name like 'Beijing', 'New York', or 'Eiffel Tower'. Returns the coordinates and additional location details.\",\n      \"name\": \"geocoding\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"location\": {\n            \"description\": \"The location name to geocode. Must use 'location' as the parameter name. Examples: 'Beijing', 'Times Square', 'Tokyo Tower'\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"location\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Get weather and forecast information for a specific location. This tool provides comprehensive weather data including temperature, humidity, wind speed, precipitation probability, and weather conditions. Use this tool when user asks about weather, temperature, or forecast for any location. Requires latitude and longitude coordinates of the location.\",\n      \"name\": \"query_weather\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"days\": {\n            \"description\": \"Number of days to forecast (default: 7, max: 16)\",\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"latitude\": {\n            \"description\": \"The latitude coordinate of the location (e.g., 39.9042 for Beijing)\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"longitude\": {\n            \"description\": \"The longitude coordinate of the location (e.g., 116.4074 for Beijing)\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"latitude\",\n          \"longitude\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"传入date获取date对应日期和时间的详细信息，只要问今天适合干什么，问今天的运势，只要关于运气，玄学等等关于气运的都要调用这个接口。\\n\\t支持星座、儒略日、干支、生肖、节气、节日、彭祖百忌、吉神(喜神/福神/财神/阳贵神/阴贵神)方位、胎神方位、冲煞、纳音、星宿、八字、五行、十神、建除十二值星、青龙名堂等十二神、黄道日及吉凶、法定节假日及调休等,about almanac\",\n      \"name\": \"get_date_info_about_almanac\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"date\": {\n            \"description\": \"必要参数，指定查询的日期，格式为'YYYY-MM-DD'，如'2023-01-01'，或者不指定，则默认为当前时间\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"date\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Calculates time by adding or subtracting duration from current time. Args format: 'operation:duration' where operation is 'add' or 'subtract', and duration is like '1h30m' (hours and minutes)\",\n      \"name\": \"calculate_time\",\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"duration\": {\n            \"description\": \"The duration to add or subtract, e.g., '1h30m' for 1 hour and 30 minutes\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"operation\": {\n            \"description\": \"The operation to perform: 'add' or 'subtract'\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"operation\",\n          \"duration\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"执行规划失败，返回的错误是：Failed to get outputchan from context"},{"role":"user","content":"全部规划执行完成，以下是执行结果："},{"role":"user","content":"任务规划完成，执行步骤结果是：.集合以上信息，请给我任务的最终结果。或者是否需要继续执行其他步骤？"}],"stream":true,"max_tokens":3000}} 0x7ff75c2375e0 11238 [] false dashscope.aliyuncs.com map[] map[] <nil> map[]   <nil> <nil> <nil>  {{}} <nil> [] map[]}
